@startuml
actor Operador
participant "React" as Web
participant "Express API" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "Socket.IO" as Socket
actor Administrador as Admin

Operador -> Web : envia contato
Web -> API : POST /contacts
API -> API : sessão + RBAC + Zod
API -> DB : transação: Contact + Notification + AuditLog
DB --> API : commit
API -> Socket : contact:created
Socket --> Admin : notificação em tempo real
API --> Web : 201 Contact
Web --> Operador : confirma cadastro
@enduml

